		{
			dependencies: ["14B46980C5503330"]
			description: [
				"The &6LEIR&r part of an accelerator complex will itself reduce beam energy from main rings but wont decelerate particles all the way."
				""
				"From &6LEIR&r the beam will be passed through several other systems:"
				""
				"&aAD Target&r Producing the antiprotons."
				""
				"&dAD Ring&r --> &bELENA&r. To decelerate the antiprotons."
				""
				"Here the beam of antiprotons will be moving slowly enough &7(0.1 MeV)&r to be used in research."
				""
				"&7(Aegis, ALPHA, ALPHA-g, ASACUSA Cusp, ASACUSA antiprotonic Helium, BASE and GBAR)&r"
			]
			icon: "compactmachines:wall"
