		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1C6F2847B6AA9618"]
			description: [
				"A &bProton Synchrotron Booster&r &7(PSB)&r is an accelerator ring designed to accelerate individual protons to near light speed. "
				""
				"This machine is primarily used to hook up to larger accelerators, with itself fed by a &dLINAC&r system, as a sort of \"primary speed-up\" but can itself be used for research."
				""
				"The main research contribution is when attached to &aIsotope Separator Online DEvice&r &7(ISOLDE)&r extremely pure and exotic isotopes of certain elements can be collected for research or medical applications."
			]
			icon: "chemlib:hydrogen"
			id: "14B46980C5503330"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4632F43673EA8DE2"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Very Fast Protons"
			x: -5.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4268E94ACC5F5ED8"]
			description: [
				"Your first accelerator in the shape of a donut."
				""
				"These machines are far more compact than &dLINACs&r which makes them ideal for cramming into certain processes within a factory."
				""
				"Cyclotrons are&a primarily used in research&r but find use in medical applications."
			]
			icon: "compactmachines:wall"
			id: "1C6F2847B6AA9618"
			tasks: [{
				id: "4C1F9C6C96117509"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Cyclotron"
			x: -3.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["1C6F2847B6AA9618"]
			description: [
				"&aFluorine-18&r is a short lived isotope that can be produced from cyclotrons."
				""
				"In medical settings some hospitals can have a cyclotron in the basement to produce &afluorine-18&r on demand to attach to glucose and administer to a patient."
				""
				"Because things like cancer &7(usually)&r absorb sugar at a higher rate, the &afluorine-18&r is taken in much more than surrounding tissues."
				""
				"As the &afluorine-18&r decays positrons are produced and annihilate with electrons to produce gamma radiation. This radiation is then picked up by fancy crystals, downconverted, and recorded as a signal."
				""
				"This is how a PET Scan works."
				""
				"PET Scanners will improve the effectiveness of diagnosis and treatment of your fancy &6GMO'ed&r creatures."
			]
			icon: "compactmachines:wall"
			id: "2B224FC3EB51A270"
			tasks: [{
				id: "12480F81EF24B3CC"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Extra Spicy Fluorine"
			x: -4.5d
			y: -1.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["14B46980C5503330"]
			description: [
				"A sub-system called &6LEIR&r &7(Low Energy Ion Ring)&r can be used between a heavy ion &dLINAC&r and &bPSB&r to accelerate or decelerate heavier atomic nuclei or work for deceleration infrastructure."
				""
				"The main use case for &6LEIR&r is to decelerate things produced from the main accelerators. &cAntimatter&r being the major one."
				""
				"Accelerated heavy nuclei can also be diverted into target samples to produce &eultra heavy synthetic elements&r."
			]
			icon: "compactmachines:wall"
			id: "2D0F7E4F8A2B0FDE"
			tasks: [{
				id: "7A620968A43E374B"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Alchemy the hard way"
			x: -6.5d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"2D0F7E4F8A2B0FDE"
				"4BC4922AEBF81C8F"
			]
			description: [
				"Ultra heavy synthetic elements are produced by colliding one material into another at high speeds and &ehoping for the best.&r"
				""
				"This method produces very large nuclei that are at the &acorrect proton count&r but &clack enough neutrons&r. Which is why these elements tend to be &chorrifically unstable&r."
				""
				"Elements produced will count almost entirely as research since most will rot away in a single in-game tick."
			]
			icon: "chemlib:oganesson"
			id: "6974826F5E8335CA"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3E51BBFC642B6392"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Terrible Bombardment Routs"
			x: -6.5d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["2D5173EA12F7B0BF"]
			description: [
				"The &dLinear Particle Accelerator&r is your first generation particle accelerator."
				""
				"These machines are basically a &abig tube of magnets&r that make very tiny things go very very fast."
				""
				"&bTier 7&r begins a trend in the progression where science is not shunted to the end of a tier but instead works together as you progress through the tier."
				""
				"&dLINACs&r initially will be involved in particle physics research for the purpose of improving accelerator technology."
				""
				"Use-cases for the factory will stem off as &ebyproducts&r to progressing through accelerator technologies, eventually landing at large scale fusion."
			]
			icon: "compactmachines:wall"
			id: "4268E94ACC5F5ED8"
			tasks: [{
				id: "3393D65D0D6017BD"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "LINAC"
			x: -2.0d
			y: 0.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["4268E94ACC5F5ED8"]
			description: [
				"Slicing up &aMonocrystalline Silicon&r can be quite the pain given the massive material cost per boule."
				""
				"It especially hurts when &chalf of the boule gets turned to dust&r by slicing into them."
				""
				"By using a LINAC system you can &ddouble&r your raw wafer efficiency by embeding atoms a few layers behind the silicon, allowing a disk to pop off in one piece. &bCutting waste to nearly zero&r."
			]
			icon: "compactmachines:wall"
			id: "41C9A53B03DF4A33"
			tasks: [{
				id: "34911C2DC1CC5859"
				type: "checkmark"
			}]
			title: "Hyper Efficient Wafers"
			x: -2.5d
			y: 1.0d
		}
		{
			dependencies: [
				"4268E94ACC5F5ED8"
				"2B224FC3EB51A270"
			]
			description: [
				"&dLINACs&r and &dCyclotrons&r can be used in directed beam therapies to blast cancers to biological dust. "
				""
				"The second to last improvement of treatment for creatures."
			]
			icon: "compactmachines:wall"
